# Non-runtime files — excluded from Vercel uploads.
# The production build (`npm run build` = tsc -b && vite build) only needs
# src/, index.html, and the TS/Vite config. Everything below is docs, tests,
# audits, or local scratch that bloats the upload (docs/ alone is ~1.4 GB and
# breaks Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit).

docs
snapshots
e2e
playwright.config.ts
test-results
scripts
.superpowers
.recovered
.cache
mediCalm-review-snapshot.zip
*.log
LICENSE
SECURITY.md
